@startuml
[*] --> Initial State

Initial State --> Browsing Products : User starts browsing
Initial State --> Searching Products : User starts searching

Browsing Products --> Generating Recommendations : Process browsing history
Browsing Products --> Browsing Products : Continue browsing
Browsing Products --> Searching Products : Switch to searching

Searching Products --> Generating Recommendations : Process search query
Searching Products --> Searching Products : Refine search
Searching Products --> Browsing Products : Switch to browsing

Generating Recommendations --> Displaying Recommendations : Generate personalized suggestions

Displaying Recommendations --> Final State : User stops interaction
Displaying Recommendations --> Browsing Products : User continues browsing
Displaying Recommendations --> Searching Products : User continues searching

Final State --> [*]
@enduml
